gin":"spolitov","id":891914,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MTkxNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/891914?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov","html_url":"https://github.com/spolitov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"spolitov","id":891914,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MTkxNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/891914?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov","html_url":"https://github.com/spolitov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2019-08-06T14:20:21Z","updated_at":"2019-08-19T17:31:04Z","closed_at":"2019-08-19T17:31:04Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"With version 1.3.1.0, using Jepsen ed8ecfb9146816cb99e458c9cb92f59e19a7b78f, the append test uses `insert ... on conflict (k) do update ...` to insert or update records in place. This table has two columns: a primary integer key `k`, and a text `v`.\r\n\r\n```clj\r\n           :append\r\n           (do (c/execute! conn\r\n                           [(str \"insert into \" table \" (k, v) values (?, ?) \"\r\n                                 \"on conflict (k) do update set \"\r\n                                 \"v = CONCAT(\" table \".v, ',', ?)\")\r\n                            k (str v) (str v)])\r\n```\r\n\r\nYou would think that when there exists a row with some key `k`, this would update the associated `v` using `CONCAT`, and indeed it does--some of the time. Other times, however, it throws:\r\n\r\n```\r\nERROR: duplicate key value violates unique constraint \"append1_pkey\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nSee, for instance, [20190806T095424.000-0400.zip](https://github.com/YugaByte/yugabyte-db/files/3472710/20190806T095424.000-0400.zip)\r\n\r\nThis happens whether we use `on conflict (k)` or explicitly specify the index via`on conflict on constraint append1_pkey`\", and it happens regardless of whether `k` is a primary key, or simply a unique column. You can reproduce it with any append test, e.g.\r\n\r\n```\r\nlein run test --os debian --version 1.3.1.0 --time-limit 300 -w ysql/append --concurrency 5n\r\n```","closed_by":{"login":"spolitov","id":891914,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MTkxNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/891914?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov","html_url":"https://github.com/spolitov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/1974/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/1974/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}